</tr>
<tr>
<td align="left" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Qualitative synthesis subjectivity</td>
<td align="left" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Reviewer interpretation may affect categorization and trend identification</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="left" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Rapid evolution of XAI</td>
<td align="left" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Some recent methods not reflected in dataset due to publication lag</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="left" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">No meta-analysis</td>
<td align="left" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Limits the statistical strength of synthesis and risk of bias estimation</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="left" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Domain skewness</td>
<td align="left" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">May not reflect modality-specific requirements for underrepresented data types</td>
