<td align="left" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Lack of diverse stakeholders</td>
<td align="left" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Omits critical perspectives from patients and non-clinical users</td>
